<title>SRI LANKA: Cricket-Rain washes out Australia-India Singer Cup match.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Rain washes out Australia-India Singer Cup match.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain washed out the Singer Cup one-day match between Australia and India on Thursday.</p>
<p>Officials said the match to decide who will meet Sri Lanka in Saturday's final will be played on Friday.</p>
<p>If Friday's match is also rained out, Australia will go through to the final on superior run rate.</p>
<p>Australia have a run rate of 1.05 compared to India's 0.02.</p>
</text>
